  m_text: 'HIGH FREQUENCY OPTICS


    This pipeline that houses the inputs and outputs
    of the high-frequency gravitational waves runs along the long tunnels connecting
    the 3 Einstein Telescope detectors, and connects with the mainbeamsplitter in
    the smaller cavern of the detector. '
